{"name": "Brigador Killers", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Isometric insurgent simulator. Fight on foot and in vehicles, build and steal a private arsenal and bring the war home to the businessmen who started it all in this continuation of the Brigador saga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/5a810937c0f3d1059fb010db91497de0.poster.avif?t=1787262286\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/5a810937c0f3d1059fb010db91497de0.webm?t=1787262286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/5a810937c0f3d1059fb010db91497de0.mp4?t=1787262286\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a member of Team Anchor, deployed to the SNC homeworld to make them pay for what they did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/07d7d911d4a007e86de39285569356c3.poster.avif?t=1787262286\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/07d7d911d4a007e86de39285569356c3.webm?t=1787262286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/07d7d911d4a007e86de39285569356c3.mp4?t=1787262286\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get around Mar Nosso on foot, or go loud against local forces with your own armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/3ec9e843ada8509cff6ef1c627f4c369.poster.avif?t=1787262286\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/3ec9e843ada8509cff6ef1c627f4c369.webm?t=1787262286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/3ec9e843ada8509cff6ef1c627f4c369.mp4?t=1787262286\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire and fire 30+ firearms, from Nossian Corvid zipguns to the latest in man-portable Spacer tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/a5a793c03ded2465dbae234ac1016ede.poster.avif?t=1787262286\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/a5a793c03ded2465dbae234ac1016ede.webm?t=1787262286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/a5a793c03ded2465dbae234ac1016ede.mp4?t=1787262286\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade your arsenal</strong> by finding different combat rigs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Salvage vehicles</strong> for parts to fabricate new tools of destruction in your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mount weapons to your new creations and <strong>deploy with them</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive around\u00a0<strong>rich detailed sprite environments </strong>in vehicles like clapped-out sedans, tanks or bipedal mechs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to an original soundtrack scored by acclaimed musician\u00a0<strong>Makeup And Vanity Set</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disrupt the corporate control of Mar Nosso by <strong>killing Brigadors</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/9d8546b2e472919c1ebc2539138d0cba.poster.avif?t=1787262286\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/9d8546b2e472919c1ebc2539138d0cba.webm?t=1787262286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/extras/9d8546b2e472919c1ebc2539138d0cba.mp4?t=1787262286\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brigador Killers is in active development and coming to a Steam store near you.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Isometric insurgent simulator. Fight on foot and in vehicles, build and steal a private arsenal and bring the war home to the businessmen who started it all in this continuation of the Brigador saga.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/903930/1052feff3eb214f3436f555ed057c632924613a7/header.jpg?t=1787262286", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Cyberpunk", "Action", "Sci-fi", "Isometric", "Dystopian"], "developers": "Stellar Jockeys, Gausswerks", "publishers": "Stellar Jockeys, Gausswerks", "release_date": "Aug 20, 2026", "price": "$14.98", "appid": "903930", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/9G4_uAx2NOo", "first_seen": 17781